<title>INDIA: CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD PRESIDENT'S XI 85-2 V AUSTRALIA AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIAN BOARD PRESIDENT'S XI 85-2 V AUSTRALIA AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PATIALA, India 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Board President's XI</p>
<p>were 85 for two at close on the second day of the three-day</p>
<p>match against Australia on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 358-8 declared; Board XI 85-2.</p>
</text>
